NOT PROFESSIONAL ADVICE

The Software produces cost estimates from configurable assumptions. Those
assumptions are documented in the Software and are not, and must not be
presented as, measured costs of any agency, nor as legal, actuarial, financial
or human resources advice. Any figure the Software produces is only as reliable
